cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "bysound: a robust near-ultrasonic data-over-sound modem"
abstract: >-
  Near-ultrasonic data-over-sound modem (MFSK on a 46.875 Hz grid, Reed-Solomon
  blocks, CRC-32) with a session layer (acknowledgements, second-sender detection,
  alerts, security levels, channel adaptation), implemented in TypeScript, Swift,
  Kotlin and C, with a reproducible benchmark against ggwave.
authors:
